CIVIL AERONAUTICS BOARD 
Salaries and expenses: For necessary expenses of the Civil Aero­
nautics Board, including contract stenographic reporting services; 
employment of temporary guards on a contract or fee basis; salaries 
and traveling expenses of employees detailed to attend courses of train­
ing conducted by the Government or industries serving aviation; 
purchase (not to exceed two for replacement only) of passenger motor 
vehicles; and hire, operation, maintenance, and repair of aircraft; 
$4,125,000.
